    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "把上面线段的垂直平分线的性质的题设和结论反过来，得到的命题还成立吗？即如果 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "P A = P B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，那么点P是否在线段AB的垂直平分线上呢？"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        103,
        390,
        847,
        440
      ],
      "reading_order": 15,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        223,
        1197,
